# Applies to every route on the deployment.
#
# The X-Robots-Tag line below is temporary: it keeps the pre-launch review
# deployment out of search results so it cannot compete with the live
# bartsbarbershop.org site. REMOVE THAT ONE LINE AT LAUNCH and keep the rest.
#
# Comments stay at column 0. Cloudflare expects a path at column 0 followed by
# indented header lines, so an indented "#" risks being parsed as a header.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
